<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第二幕 · HARNESS 里头</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>看清：每一步都留下痕迹</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 420, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#0F6E56"}}>trace</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)"}}>模型步骤 · 工具调用 · 重试 · 产出</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#0F6E56"}}>provenance</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)"}}>产物是谁造的、从哪来</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#0F6E56"}}>CI 出口</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)"}}>每一次交付可审计</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 708, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>看清：每一步都留下痕迹</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55}}>关键在于：这些痕迹不是事后补的，是执行时自动留下的。</Text><Box style={{padding: 22, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, marginTop: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56"}}>你们本来就要求「出事能还原」——现在把它也套上。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>20 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
